'''Vulptereens'''<ref name="Force Collection">{{ForceCollection|Dud Bolt|star=1}}</ref> were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that had a shovel-like [[mouth]] with six tusks, a feeler on their snout, and two pointed [[ear]]s.<ref name="The Phantom Menace" /> A Vulptereen [[podracer]] named [[Dud Bolt]],<ref name="Force Collection" /> who was [[Homeworld|native]] to [[Vulpter]],<ref name="CompleteVehicles">''[[Star Wars Complete Vehicles, New Edition]]''</ref> participated in the [[Boonta Eve Classic]] on [[Tatooine]] in [[32 BBY]].<ref name="Force Collection" />

